#. ~ Description of MOD "Berserk"
#: modinfo.json
msgid ""
"Adds content inspired by Kentaro Miura's Berserk. Face beings tied to the "
"God Hand, battle legendary demons, or forge and wield Guts' legendary sword."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Profession name
#: professions/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Berserker"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Profession name
#: professions/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Berserker"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Profession description
#: professions/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "You are a brute forged in a world-sized meat grinder, where zombies are little more than an excuse to exercise your fists and enormous sword. Illiterate but brutally capable, you cut down the dead like firewood. Now you wear cursed armor that steadily takes hold of your mind. How did you get here? It hardly matters—in this hell, strength is your ticket to another day."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Profession description
#: professions/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "You are a brute forged in a world-sized meat grinder, where zombies are little more than an excuse to exercise your fists and enormous sword. Illiterate but brutally capable, you cut down the dead like firewood. Now you wear cursed armor that steadily takes hold of your mind. How did you get here? It hardly matters—in this hell, strength is your ticket to another day."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Profession name
#: professions/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Berserk Fan"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Profession name
#: professions/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Berserk Fan"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Profession description
#: professions/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You reread every volume of Berserk while zombies hammered on your apartment "
"door and decided: 'If Guts could do it, so can I!' You may lack his "
"strength, but you have a homemade copy of his sword, a stylish hoodie, and a"
" bandana—everything you need to look the part. In this apocalypse you have a"
" DREAM, even if you do not have much of a chance. Perhaps one day you too "
"will be free."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Profession description
#: professions/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You reread every volume of Berserk while zombies hammered on your apartment "
"door and decided: 'If Guts could do it, so can I!' You may lack his "
"strength, but you have a homemade copy of his sword, a stylish hoodie, and a"
" bandana—everything you need to look the part. In this apocalypse you have a"
" DREAM, even if you do not have much of a chance. Perhaps one day you too "
"will be free."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: items/forged_guts_sword.json
msgid "Forged Guts' Sword"
msgid_plural "Forged Guts' Swords"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Item description
#: items/forged_guts_sword.json
msgid ""
"This massive blade is your painstaking attempt to recreate Guts' legendary "
"sword, whispered about among survivors. Forged from hardened steel, it is "
"almost like the weapon said to have cut through dragons and apostles—if "
"those stories were true. Heavy, crude, and sharp, it reaches far and hits "
"hard: perfect for zombies or something worse."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: items/true_guts_sword.json
msgid "Guts' True Sword"
msgid_plural "Guts' True Swords"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Item description
#: items/true_guts_sword.json
msgid "In Guts' hands, this massive blade handles as if it were much lighter than its size suggests, even when wielded with one hand. It was made to hew enemies apart, embodying strength and determination worthy of a legendary weapon."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: items/nosferatu_zodd_sword.json
msgid "Nosferatu Zodd's Sword"
msgid_plural "Nosferatu Zodd's Swords"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Item description
#: items/nosferatu_zodd_sword.json
msgid ""
"A colossal sword wielded by the fearsome Nosferatu Zodd. Forged in a brutal "
"style reminiscent of Kushan craftsmanship, it cleaves flesh and bone with "
"ease. Only the mightiest can wield it effectively."
msgstr ""

